    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dive into the world of RetroFight, an exhilarating multiplayer strategy game where every move counts, and retroactivity is the key to victory!</h2><br>Challenge up to 5 other players in epic turn-based battles where every decision impacts your next move retroactively.<br><br>Anticipate your opponents' actions, choose your next move carefully, adapt to unexpected twists, and become the master of temporal strategy! <br>With its multiple settings and innovative gameplay, RetroFight promises hours of intense entertainment.<br><br>Explore diverse arenas, challenge your friends online, and prove your supremacy in breathtaking strategic battles.<br><br>Are you ready to take on the challenge and write your legend in RetroFight history?",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dive into the world of RetroFight, an exhilarating multiplayer strategy game where every move counts, and retroactivity is the key to victory!</h2><br>Challenge up to 5 other players in epic turn-based battles where every decision impacts your next move retroactively.<br><br>Anticipate your opponents' actions, choose your next move carefully, adapt to unexpected twists, and become the master of temporal strategy! <br>With its multiple settings and innovative gameplay, RetroFight promises hours of intense entertainment.<br><br>Explore diverse arenas, challenge your friends online, and prove your supremacy in breathtaking strategic battles.<br><br>Are you ready to take on the challenge and write your legend in RetroFight history?",
